  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Strengthen Partnerships for Inclusion Resilience and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth in East Shewa and West Arsi Zone of Oromia and Northern Zone and Hawassa of Sidama in Ethiopia will improve access and participation in inclusive secondary education and learning outcomes. It will provide education pathways for marginalized, out-of-school youth, including girls and youth with disabilities and IDPs in remote areas. It will strengthen the competency of teachers to provide effective teaching. Youth will engage in advocacy about their rights through school clubs.</narrative>
  </description>
